<Layout title="about">
    <div class="container">
        <pre class="avatar">{avatar}</pre>
        <div class="resume">
            <a href="/resume.pdf">View Resume</a>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h1>Howdy!</h1>
            <p>
                I'm Rendra. I'm <strong>Software Engineer</strong> dedicated to crafting
                things for mobile through coding.
            </p>
            <p>
                Welcome to my spot on the web for writing, projects, tutorials,
                and anything else I want to put out there.
            </p>
            <p>
                My site has
                <span>no ads</span>,
                <span>no AI-generated content</span>,
                <span>no affiliate links</span>,
                <span>no sponsored posts</span>,<span>and no paywall</span>.
                It's a space for self-expression and to share what I've learned
                with the world. I hope I can inspire others to make their own
                creative corner on the web in the uphill battle against the
                <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enshittification"
                    >enshittification</a
                > of the internet.
            </p>
            <p>
                I wrote my first lines of code back in 2013 of HTML and CSS
                using notepad. Like many people I graduated a few years later
                and since then I've been on this adventure into the world of
                programming.
            </p>
            <p>
                I don't have "favorites", but i like to code on Java, Kotlin and
                I'm starting to tiker with Golang. I also like to think outside
                of coding, such prioritizing tasks/features, doing reviews and
                providing the good practices, fundamentals, and consistency
                throughout the code.
            </p>
            <p>I've worked on Android (Kotlin), iOS(Flutter) and backend.</p>
            <p>
                Personally, I'm into computers, playing video games, and
                reading.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
